{"title":"Ornot Introduces the Fog Eater Hooded Rain Jacket so You Can Stay Dry, Ornot","link":"https://bikerumor.com/ornot-introduces-the-fog-eater-hooded-rain-jacket-so-you-can-stay-dry-ornot/","date":1792086056000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-Eater-lead.jpeg\" width=\"1262\" height=\"841\" alt=\"(All photos / Ornot)\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/?s=ornot\">Ornot made a name for itself </a>with its high-quality, technical, minimally-branded cycling apparel that doesn’t make you look like a rolling billboard. The latest addition to the lineup is the brand-new Fog Eater Hooded Rain Jacket, a fitting name, considering Ornot is based in often-foggy San Francisco, California. It’s made with a 3L Pertex Shield fabric, boasts 20k/20k waterproof/breathability, and packs into its own pocket when not in use. Let’s take a look.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-eater-riding.jpeg\"><img width=\"1157\" height=\"771\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-eater-riding.jpeg\" alt=\"two people riding on an overcast day on wet gravel roads.\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-eater-riding.jpeg 1157w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-eater-riding-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-eater-riding-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-eater-riding-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-eater-riding-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-eater-riding-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Ornot Fog Eater Hooded Rain Jacket Details</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Ornot tells us that the Fog Eater was inspired by a mountaineering shell and adapted for the bike. First and foremost, it’s a rain jacket, and it’s made with a 3-layer Pertex Shield fabric with fully taped seams and a PFC-free DWR to give it a 20k waterproof / 20k breathability rating. At just 87gsm, this fabric also helps keep it lightweight, and the jacket weighs a claimed 280 grams in size medium. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5945_V2_Edited-scaled.jpeg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"2303\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5945_V2_Edited-1536x2303.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a woman wearing the Ornot Fog eater Hooded Rain Jacket\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5945_V2_Edited-1536x2303.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5945_V2_Edited-200x300.jpeg 200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5945_V2_Edited-80x120.jpeg 80w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5945_V2_Edited-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5945_V2_Edited-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5945_V2_Edited-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5945_V2_Edited-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5945_V2_Edited-scaled.jpeg 1707w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0377_Edited-scaled.jpeg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"2302\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0377_Edited-1536x2302.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a man wearing the Ornot Fog eater Hooded Rain Jacket zipping the hood up\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0377_Edited-1536x2302.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0377_Edited-200x300.jpeg 200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0377_Edited-80x120.jpeg 80w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0377_Edited-768x1151.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0377_Edited-1025x1536.jpeg 1025w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0377_Edited-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0377_Edited-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0377_Edited-scaled.jpeg 1708w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-12-scaled.jpeg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"2302\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-12-1536x2302.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a man wearing the Ornot Fog eater Hooded Rain Jacket with the hood up\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-12-1536x2302.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-12-200x300.jpeg 200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-12-80x120.jpeg 80w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-12-768x1151.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-12-1025x1536.jpeg 1025w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-12-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-12-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-12-scaled.jpeg 1708w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Ornot says the Fog Eater has a slim but slightly relaxed fit designed to layer underneath and still perform on the bike, but is relaxed enough to not look out of place with a pair of pants. The cycling-oriented fit includes a shorter cut in the front, a dropped tail for extra coverage in the back, and articulated arms for comfort in the riding position. It’s got a drawcord hem and a three-way adjustable hood that’s designed to fit under a helmet when you need to seal out the elements.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_6000_Edited-scaled.jpeg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"2302\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_6000_Edited-1536x2302.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a woman wearing the Ornot Fog eater Hooded Rain Jacket using the 2-way zipper\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_6000_Edited-1536x2302.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_6000_Edited-200x300.jpeg 200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_6000_Edited-80x120.jpeg 80w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_6000_Edited-768x1151.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_6000_Edited-1025x1536.jpeg 1025w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_6000_Edited-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_6000_Edited-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_6000_Edited-scaled.jpeg 1708w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-8-scaled.jpeg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"2304\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-8-1536x2304.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a man packing the Ornot Fog Eater into its own pocket\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-8-1536x2304.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-8-200x300.jpeg 200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-8-80x120.jpeg 80w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-8-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-8-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-8-1365x2048.jpeg 1365w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-8-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot_Mens-RainJacket-FogEater-Citron-FullRes-8-scaled.jpeg 1707w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5968_Edited-scaled.jpeg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"2304\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5968_Edited-1536x2304.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a woman wearing the Ornot Fog eater Hooded Rain Jacket pulling the drawcord hem\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5968_Edited-1536x2304.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5968_Edited-200x300.jpeg 200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5968_Edited-80x120.jpeg 80w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5968_Edited-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5968_Edited-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5968_Edited-1365x2048.jpeg 1365w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5968_Edited-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5968_Edited-scaled.jpeg 1707w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The Fog Eater has a 2-way front zipper to vent from the top or bottom or access your jersey pockets. It also features internal drop pockets, a zippered rear pocket, plus two zippered hand warmer pockets. The left hand pocket doubles as a stuff sack, and the jacket packs down to a 6” x 6” pouch when you aren’t wearing it. And like any good cycling apparel, the Fog Eater has reflective details to make you visible when you’re cutting through the fog.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-Eater-waterproof.jpeg\"><img width=\"540\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-Eater-waterproof.jpeg\" alt=\"water beading on the shell of the Ornot Fog Eater Jacket\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-Eater-waterproof.jpeg 540w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-Eater-waterproof-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-Eater-waterproof-120x120.jpeg 120w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-Eater-reflective.jpeg\"><img width=\"540\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-Eater-reflective.jpeg\" alt=\"a person riding in wet and dim light conditions in the Ornot Fog Eater jacket.\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-Eater-reflective.jpeg 540w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-Eater-reflective-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ornot-Fog-Eater-reflective-120x120.jpeg 120w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<h3>Specs and Features</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>87 gsm 3-layer Pertex Shield, 20K waterproof / 20K breathable </li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fully taped seams, PFC-free DWR</li>\n\n\n\n<li>280 grams (size medium) </li>\n\n\n\n<li>Packs into its own pocket</li>\n\n\n\n<li>3-point adjustable hood w/ rain peak, fits under helmet</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Adjustable hem</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hand warmer pockets (left pocket is a stuff sack)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Internal drop pockets, zippered rear pocket</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Reflective details</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sizes:\n<ul>\n<li>Men’s XS – XXL</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Women’s: XS – XL</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Colors:\n<ul>\n<li>Men’s: Stone Green / Citron</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Women’s: Citron</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5974_Edited-scaled.jpeg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"2303\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5974_Edited-1536x2303.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a woman wearing the Ornot Fog eater Hooded Rain Jacket tightening the hood\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5974_Edited-1536x2303.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5974_Edited-200x300.jpeg 200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5974_Edited-80x120.jpeg 80w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5974_Edited-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5974_Edited-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5974_Edited-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5974_Edited-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5974_Edited-scaled.jpeg 1707w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0214_Edited-scaled.jpeg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"2302\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0214_Edited-1536x2302.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a man wearing the Ornot Fog eater Hooded Rain Jacket using the 2-way zipper\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0214_Edited-1536x2302.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0214_Edited-200x300.jpeg 200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0214_Edited-80x120.jpeg 80w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0214_Edited-768x1151.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0214_Edited-1025x1536.jpeg 1025w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0214_Edited-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0214_Edited-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260219_OrNot_0214_Edited-scaled.jpeg 1708w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5962_Edited-scaled.jpeg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"2302\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5962_Edited-1536x2302.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a woman wearing the Ornot Fog eater Hooded Rain Jacket using the back pocket\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5962_Edited-1536x2302.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5962_Edited-200x300.jpeg 200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5962_Edited-80x120.jpeg 80w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5962_Edited-768x1151.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5962_Edited-1025x1536.jpeg 1025w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5962_Edited-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5962_Edited-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260307_OrNot_5962_Edited-scaled.jpeg 1708w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Pricing and Availability</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The Fog Eater Hooded Rain Jacket retails for $325 and is available now direct from Ornot. Head to the Ornot website to learn more, or check out their full line of cycling and lifestyle apparel, most of which is made in the USA.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.avantlink.com/click.php?tt=cl&amp;mi=23377&amp;pw=293233&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ornotbike.com%2Fcollections%2Fjacket-and-vests%2Fproducts%2Fmens-fog-eater-hooded-rain-jacket-stone-green\">ornotbike.com</a></em></p>","author":"Jeremy Benson","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/ornot-introduces-the-fog-eater-hooded-rain-jacket-so-you-can-stay-dry-ornot/#comments","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"5bbdf7a843616735a6c6c48f244c7f3c335196f70a9ae245690d3e509f6e77c7","category":"Cycling"}